---
/**
 * परिभाषा — the formal definition block.
 *
 * Every grammar topic opens with one. Giving it a fixed, recognisable
 * shape means a reader who lands mid-page from a search result can find
 * the definition without reading a word of the surrounding prose.
 */
---

<aside
  class="my-6 rounded-card border border-hairline border-s-2 border-s-(--khand) bg-(--khand-soft) p-5 md:p-6"
>
  <p class="eyebrow text-(--khand)">परिभाषा</p>
  <div class="mt-2 text-lead text-ink [&>p]:m-0 [&>p+p]:mt-3">
    <slot />
  </div>
</aside>
